			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Stops\n1. 8 - Royal Station \n2. 7 - Angel Tower \n3. 3 - Aries Crossing \n4. 10 - Tanner Fork \n5. 1 - Oris Train Hall \n6. 13 - Dead End ",
